Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuelIntro::
	.string "This is where I do my training!$"

Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuelDefeat::
	.string "What happened?$"

Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuel::
	.string "I’m going to train even harder\p"
	.string "After all, I’m trying to become\n"
	.string "a GYM LEADER.$"

Route34_Text_PokefanBrandonIntro::
	.string "I just got my POKéMON back from\n"
	.string "DAY-CARE.\p"
	.string "Let’s see how much stronger it got!$"

Route34_Text_PokefanBrandonDefeat::
	.string "Why does it end this way?$"

Route34_Text_PokefanBrandon::
	.string "My POKéMON knew moves I didn’t\n"
	.string "know it had.\p"
	.string "That confounded me to no end!$"

Route34_Text_YoungsterIanIntro::
	.string "I’m the best in my class at POKéMON.$"

Route34_Text_YoungsterIanDefeat::
	.string "No! There are better trainers...$"

Route34_Text_YoungsterIan::
	.string "I’m trying hard so I can be the star\n"
	.string "in my class.$"

Route34_Text_OfficerKeithIntro::
	.string "Who goes there?\n"
	.string "What are you up to?$"

Route34_Text_OfficerKeithDefeat::
	.string "You’re a tough little guy.$"

Route34_Text_OfficerKeith::
	.string "Yep, I see nothing wrong today. You\n"
	.string "be good and stay out of trouble.$"

Route34_Text_Camper148Intro::
	.string "I’m confident in my ability to\n"
	.string "raise POKéMON.\l"
	.string "Want to see?$"

Route34_Text_Camper148Defeat::
	.string "I didn’t do a good enough job?$"

Route34_Text_Camper148::
	.string "Maybe I should leave one in\n"
	.string "DAY-CARE.\l"
	.string "What should I do?$"

Route34_Text_Picnicker152Intro::
	.string "Are you a trainer?\n"
	.string "Let’s have a practice battle.$"

Route34_Text_Picnicker152Defeat::
	.string "Oh, no! I just can’t win...$"

Route34_Text_Picnicker152::
	.string "You’re too strong to be a practice\n"
	.string "partner.$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerIreneIntro::
	.string "IRENE: Kyaaah!\n"
	.string "Someone found us!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerIreneDefeat::
	.string "IRENE: Ohhhh!\n"
	.string "He’s too strong!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerIrene_1::
	.string "IRENE: My sister KATE will get you\n"
	.string "for this!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerIrene_2::
	.string "IRENE: Isn’t this beach great?\n"
	.string "It’s our secret little getaway!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerJennIntro::
	.string "JENN: You can’t beat IRENE and go\n"
	.string "unpunished!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerJennDefeat::
	.string "JENN: So sorry, IRENE! Sis!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerJenn_1::
	.string "JENN: Don’t get cocky!\n"
	.string "My sister KATE is tough!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerJenn_2::
	.string "JENN: Sunlight makes your body\n"
	.string "stronger.$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerKateIntro::
	.string "KATE: You sure were mean to my\n"
	.string "little sisters!$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerKateDefeat::
	.string "KATE: No! I can’t believe I lost.$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerKate_1::
	.string "KATE: You’re too strong. I didn’t\n"
	.string "stand a chance.\p"
	.string "Here. You deserve this.$"

Route34_Text_CooltrainerKate_2::
	.string "KATE: I’m sorry we jumped you.\p"
	.string "We never expected anyone to find us\n"
	.string "here. You sure startled us.$"

Route34_Text_Sign1::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "BERRY trees grow new BERRIES\n"
	.string "everyday.\p"
	.string "Make a note of which trees bear\n"
	.string "which BERRIES.$"

Route34_Text_Sign2::
	.string "DAY-CARE\n"
	.string "Let Us Raise Your POKéMON for You!$"

